></span></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%8A%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A8%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3/%E0%B8%A0%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88_53_(2473)/%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B7%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88_2\" title=\"ประชุมพงศาวดาร/ภาคที่ 53 (2473)/เรื่องที่ 2\">พงษาวดารเมืองนครศรีธรรมราช</a></b></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><span style=\"font-size:90%;\">โดย <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%B9%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%84%E0%B9%8C:%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%93%E0%B9%8C%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%98%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A1_(%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%A7_%E0%B8%93_%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%A3)\" title=\"ผู้สร้างสรรค์:หลวงอนุสรณ์สิทธิกรรม (บัว ณ นคร)\">หลวงอนุสรณ์สิทธิกรรม (บัว ณ นคร)</a></span></span></dd></dl>\n<ul><li><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%8A%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A8%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3/%E0%B8%A0%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88_53_(2473)/%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B7%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88_3\" title=\"ประชุมพงศาวดาร/ภาคที่ 53 (2473)/เรื่องที่ 3\">จดหมายบอกข่าวถึงเจ้าพระยานครฯ</a></b></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><span style=\"font-size:90%;\">โดย <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%B9%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%84%E0%B9%8C:%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%A8%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%8A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%A2_(%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%8D%E0%B9%88)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ผู้สร้างสรรค์:นายศัลวิชัย (น้อยใหญ่)\">นายศัลวิชัย (น้อยใหญ่)</a></span> (ตามข้อสันนิษฐานของ<span class=\"plainlinks\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E0%B8%9C%E0%B8%B9%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%A3%E